cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Circadian Medicine Analysis Suite"
abstract: >
  A privacy-preserving, AI-augmented web application for clinical circadian rhythm
  and sleep-wake analysis from wearable actigraphy data. Computes validated metrics
  (IS, IV, L5/M10/RA, Cosinor, SRI, CPD) across activity, sleep, and light-exposure
  domains, and generates literature-grounded clinical reports via a local 5-agent
  LLM pipeline using LangGraph and Ollama.
